要装备一把双手武器来施展破甲！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"4cc2e869fd979da6c1e6336c7b64552b8940c2cf910dcb3876834346d09ad32b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ed3323c63dfed63f370909ea024a1022f153f8df4e3e33f659344c162c01143d","logical_entry_identity":"901370db282a7f9b3fc39f0e01fc82fdf30a077bb748a0cdfce99dda45c42655","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You strike the enemy with a rain of fast, acidic blows. You strike four times for pure acid damage. Every blow does %d%% damage.\n\t\tEvery two talent levels, one of your strikes becomes blinding acid instead of normal acid, blinding the target 25%% of the time if it hits.\n\t\tEach point in acid drake talents also increases your acid resistance by 1%%.\n\n\t\tThis talent will also attack with your shield, if you have one equipped.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你以迅疾如雨的酸性打击攻击敌人，连续攻击四次，造成纯酸性伤害。每次攻击造成 %d%% 武器伤害。\n\t\t每两个技能等级，其中一次攻击会由普通酸性伤害变为致盲酸性伤害；若命中，有 25%% 几率致盲目标。\n\t\t每投入一点毒龙系技能，酸性抗性提高 1%%。\n\n\t\t如果装备了盾牌，此技能也会使用盾牌攻击。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"7d47e458caaa7f7102e3a5795f971bef001a2b86e5fe8d7b8a7a65b27a99d908","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ed33d9f73273648c7ac6418a381fe20a01080053c5c3f1c1ab8fe1206868773f","logical_entry_identity":"3674b8c848ae81dc69ab675444332b60a6420f996ba98840f28bac6d9f4c6068","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The target is protected from silence effects.","source_tag":"_t","target":"目标免疫沉默。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"9b8bedf2e98e2c2df0ac8e267a87f82b87991f9755ec78721fef09005722ecaf","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ed3507090bb37612039a46c92071eb286314de70b8a298f5254883ade958260c","logical_entry_identity":"f404b3974b7122cbcaf5ce29381c803f6474f49d7106240ff64d3b541f4c3ccf","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Hit the target twice with your two-handed weapon, doing %d%% damage. Each hit will try to stun the target for %d turns.\n\t\tThe stun chance increases with your Physical Power.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"用你的双手武器攻击目标两次并造成 %d%% 伤害。每次攻击都会试图震慑目标 %d 回合。\n\t\t受物理强度影响，震慑概率有加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"dfc6e2d1d239f597c68712a6b1bb1aaacd87e06f073ef952084cf9ffcf5f43e3","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ed3d302924b072bbf028df160e039b86d2b670337e8ad5f6325cc33b73e55eba","logical_entry_identity":"413b0208645b2965899734cc3767027ff9aee92959e7d4723eba7811bd8a8d2c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You smack your forehead against your enemy's head (or whatever sensitive part you can find), causing %0.1f Physical damage.\n\t\tIf the attack hits, the target is confused (%d%% effect) for %d turns.\n\t\tDamage done increases with the quality of your headgear, your Strength, and your physical damage bonuses.\n\t\tConfusion power increases with your Dexterity, and chance increases with Accuracy.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你用前额猛击敌人头部（或者任意你能找到的有效位置），造成 %0.1f 物理伤害。\n\t\t如果此次攻击命中，则目标会混乱(%d%% 强度) %d 回合。\n\t\t伤害受头盔品质、力量和物理伤害加成。\n\t\t混乱强度受敏捷加成，几率受命中加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bd522f70a172aa1e9296088952c78bd4ab239c1bb267fab26c1bfa882b439fd4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ed41bdd6580f76a4f035d83daf2c50dfa58c2bf80bc92d9b447422de134cb71f","logical_entry_identity":"fd9be2588140a14456762426622ea35068fd41cc0a52172d34fc683a624964e3","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The target's mind has been shaken. It is temporarily aligned with %s and immune to all damage.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"目标的精神被支配，暂时处于 %s 阵营并免疫所有伤害。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"be59e250d07439684e181cc9ddc7c33c4d62611bfbaaa467cd3c7fd75f3d61ee","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"ed43bb411e41ab3b9edc80d988d8de2fd166c7f1662edbd92e34a528e77fcc41","logical_entry_identity":"89d1f1baf0b791eb65a4b37b4568b55adb77fbcee0692b9d9034bd900603c50e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Echoes From The Past","source_tag":"talent name","target":"往昔回响"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6209fea5dad65a8fdfe187d120e9fb0e11dee50015c180efcafbabaeb92dbaf6","component